        is known as kerambit or karambit.
    - time: 12.576
      text: It is only as big as a hand, but its story is a long one.
  - key: cakar
    title:
      id: Cakar harimau
      en: A tiger's claw
    text:
      id: 'Lihat, sarungnya meluncur lepas mengikuti lengkung bilah. Bilah ini melengkung
        seperti kuku harimau. Menurut cerita rakyat, bentuknya terinspirasi cakar
        harimau Sumatra yang dahulu banyak berkeliaran di hutan. Ini sejalan dengan
        falsafah Minangkabau, alam takambang jadi guru: alam yang terbentang adalah
        guru kita.'
      en: 'Look, the sheath slides off along the curve of the blade. The blade curves
        like a tiger''s claw. According to folklore, its shape was inspired by the
        claws of the Sumatran tiger, which once roamed the forests in great numbers.
        This fits the Minangkabau philosophy alam takambang jadi guru: nature unfolded
        is our teacher.'
    stage: 1
    focusHotspot: mata
    voiceID: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 85aec562127661e499a5140c944a8f02, type: 3}
    voiceEN: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d057c208c83aaa442a0e2ca797d9b691, type: 3}
    cuesID:
    - time: 0.1
      text: Lihat, sarungnya meluncur lepas mengikuti lengkung bilah.
    - time: 5.258
      text: Bilah ini melengkung seperti kuku harimau.
    - time: 9.282
      text: Menurut cerita rakyat, bentuknya terinspirasi cakar harimau Sumatra yang
